+# Release 0.5.0
+
+linkly v0.4 -> v0.5: security fix, click accuracy fix, link expiry
+
+## Changes
+
+- Author regression tests for LINK-142/150/151 before touching code (test-first)
+- LINK-142: reject script/data/credential URLs at the API boundary (extract validation module)
+- LINK-151: atomic click increment; 302 + no-store so browsers stop caching redirects
+- LINK-150: optional expires_in_days; 410 Gone after expiry; in-place schema migration
+
+## Evidence
+
+- [x] all tests pass: 22 passed / 0 failed
+- [x] coverage >= 85%: 99.0%
+- [x] lint clean: 0 issues
+- [x] no security findings: 0 findings
+- [x] docs generated: openapi.json, docs/API.md, docs/DESIGN.md, CHANGELOG.md
+- [x] no blocking questions open: []
+
+## Known risks / follow-ups
+
+- linkly.store.create: codes derived from sequential row ids can be enumerated
